かりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["祖母井神社","芳賀天満宮","御嶽稲荷塚古墳（芳志戸）","芳賀遊水地（芳志戸）","冨士山自然公園（上稲毛田）","青木繁"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B3%E8%B3%80%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"芳賀町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110214058","wikidata_qid":"Q1203553","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%B3%E8%B3%80%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}